# Absorb output-comparison audit checklist

- [ ] Keep baseline, archived and candidate runs distinct by immutable run identity.
- [ ] Report missing dimensions and regressions instead of treating them as zero or PASS.
- [ ] Preserve nonlocal/content/closed-element Trace distinctions in comparisons.
- [ ] Write only comparison reports; do not mutate source run artifacts.
- [ ] Do not call models, DBs, tmux, Devin, Solver or the network.
